# Keep every text file LF in the repo and in the working tree, on every OS.
# Without this, Git on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) checks files out as CRLF,
# and tools like `npx convex dev` that write LF (or vice versa) make files such
# as src/convex/_generated/api.d.ts show up as modified with no real change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Convex codegen output: always LF, never a line-ending diff.
src/convex/_generated/** text eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
